; ZX Spectrum ROM image layout.
; Written in SDCC command-file style so it can be consumed by both
; sdldz80 and xld. Use the command line to choose output format and
; explicit entry symbol if needed.
;
; Important current limitation:
; xcc still emits ordinary writable globals directly into _DATA instead of a
; full _INITIALIZER -> _INITIALIZED split. So this script keeps the ROM/RAM
; intent visible, but full initialized-data correctness still needs compiler
; support.

-b _CODE  = 0x0000
-b _DATA  = 0x8000
-e
